{"id":1388,"level":40,"name":"Захист від шаху: взяття","group":"Захист від шаху","format":35,"description":"<p>If your king is in check, you must do something about it. One way to escape check is by taking the piece that gives check.</p>  <p><br />Take a look at the board: White&rsquo;s king is in the corner. But he can save himself by taking the queen. Now he is out of check. And he has swept Black&rsquo;s strongest piece off the board as well!</p>  <p><br />If you&rsquo;re in check, moving your king is often your first thought. But don&rsquo;t forget your other pieces. They can often help to get out of check, too!</p>  <p><br /><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Your king is in check. Capture a piece to get out of check.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":3,"examples":[{"fen":"5k2/8/8/8/8/8/q7/K7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb1,Rb2]} 1. Kxa2 *","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"6k1/8/8/8/8/B7/5PPP/2r3K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Bxc1 *","text":"<p>король Уайта не може піти в безпечне місце. Білим пощастило мати ще одну фігуру. Його слон може взяти туру.</p>","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":56679,"fen":"8/8/5B2/8/8/1k6/1q6/K7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gb2a1]} {Q=1} 1. Bxb2 *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56682,"fen":"8/7B/8/8/8/6k1/8/1r4K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gb1g1]} {Q=1} 1. Bxb1 *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":57485,"fen":"8/6k1/8/8/8/5N2/5PPP/4r1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Ge1g1]} {Q=1} 1. Nxe1 *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56678,"fen":"8/8/8/8/8/7q/5kP1/7K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gh3h1]} {Q=1} 1. gxh3 *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56676,"fen":"k7/R1K5/8/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{Q=1} 1... Kxa7 *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":57484,"fen":"8/8/8